+            Owner-visible).
+        spawn_id: session-local spawn identifier or ``""`` for plan-scope.
+        tokens_used: post-spawn running total.
+        cap: configured cap (e.g. CEO_MAX_SPAWN_TOKENS).
+        scope: ``"spawn"`` | ``"plan"``.
+    """
